+# Feature Specification: Fix coupon defects
+
+**Created**: 2026-10-22 | **Status**: Draft
+**Input**: Finance and customer reports on discounts, coupon expiry and shipping VAT.
+
+## User Scenarios & Testing
+
+### Story 1 - Percentage coupon applies after volume discount (P1)
+**Acceptance**: Given 12 notebooks at €5.00 and a 10% coupon, goods come to €48.60 (6000 − 600 volume − 540 coupon).
+
+### Story 2 - Coupon valid through its last day (P1)
+**Acceptance**: Given AUTUMN valid until 2026-11-30, an order on 2026-11-30 is accepted; on 2026-12-01 it is refused as expired.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: A coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts (README, Discounts).
+- **FR-002**: A coupon is valid on its last day, inclusive (README, Discounts).
+- **FR-003**: The 50% cap still applies to the gross amount.
+
+## Out of scope / needs business decision
+- Report 3 (no VAT on shipping) contradicts README ("Shipping is subject to VAT at the standard rate (22%)"), which is authoritative. Not changed.
+
+## Assumptions
+- Fixed coupons are also capped by the post-volume subtotal, per README.
